0,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need a fair system, but we must ensure it doesn't create unnecessary friction between neighbors.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree! I've heard some people are unhappy about who gets which spot. Let's find a way to make everyone smile!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current situation is chaotic. We need to understand the actual physical usage and the daily flow before deciding.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be rational. We always talk about ""fairness,"" but nobody ever checks the actual costs or the budget. It's quite amateur.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,A system is only as good as its maintenance. I'm concerned about who will actually manage the paperwork and the effort involved.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, financial data is useful, but social stability is more important for long-term living.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,Maybe we can look at how things were done before? It might help us avoid the same mistakes!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, the administrative effort is secondary to the physical reality. If the layout is bad, no amount of paperwork fixes it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Stability is a luxury bought with money, Asuka. I want to know exactly what we are paying for and what the alternatives cost.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, physical reality is important, but if the management lapses, the physical layout becomes irrelevant. We need to see the history of these failures.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I want to know if previous rules caused conflicts. We shouldn't implement a system that makes people avoid each other in the lobby.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm really worried about the grumbling. I want to know if the same people always get the best spots or if it's just a misunderstanding.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll focus on the actual movement of the bikes. The morning rush is where the real problem lies.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll dig into the ledger. It's high time we stopped guessing and started looking at the actual numbers.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the handover files and the minutes. I want to see where previous administrative efforts failed.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's proceed with the investigations then. I'll look into the history of complaints and the minutes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll check the sticker register and the rain exposure! I want to make sure the spots are actually usable for everyone.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll observe the morning departures and check the rain exposure as well. We need to see the actual friction.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the ledger and the treasurer's file. Let's see if there's any actual money involved in this ""chaos.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll stick with the handover file and the five years of association minutes. I need to see the workload.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
